                                                "sense_id": "18d4cb4e-33ee-3c85-8081-b82186e5ce58",
                                                "text": "I leafed through the various boxes and drawers, staring sometimes for minutes on end at a star-shaped vault or diamond frieze, a hermitage, a monopteros or a mausoleum, without knowing what I was looking at or why."
